# Testing

Read `docs/workflows/testing.md` for full details.

## Key commands

```bash
npm run build                                    # Required first
node test/unit/apiCoverageAudit.test.js          # Gateway coverage gate
npx ts-node test/unit/modelResolver.test.ts      # Model resolver
npm run test:oauth                               # OAuth integration
npm run schema:check                             # Zod schemas
```

## Coverage audit success

Output must show `configCoverage: complete` for each static gateway tested.

## When changing mappings

1. Enrich `createMockDevice()` with new API datapoints
2. Update gateway mock factory in `apiCoverageAudit.test.js`
3. `npm run build && node test/unit/apiCoverageAudit.test.js`

## EXTRA_DEVICE_DATAPOINTS

Audit-only escape hatch in `apiCoverageAudit.ts` — rare, no MQTT command desired. Not a shortcut for incomplete mappings.
